    "detailed_description": "Discover the secrets behind this mysterious organization and embark on an adventure into the unknown. Solve the puzzles and fight to escape.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2207940/extras/1ac98fb04d04ed3e2cc31b6f67644182.poster.avif?t=1667592454\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2207940/extras/1ac98fb04d04ed3e2cc31b6f67644182.webm?t=1667592454\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2207940/extras/1ac98fb04d04ed3e2cc31b6f67644182.mp4?t=1667592454\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Missing Code is an action and suspense platform game, inspired by games like Portal and Inside. You will have to face various enemies and make good decisions to advance.<br><br>Let yourself be enveloped by the dark atmosphere of this unknown place and discover what mystery it hides. Use your stealth skills and arm yourself to find the answers.<br><br>Features:<br>-Unique dark 2D art<br>-Suspense environment<br>-Mix of action and stealth puzzles<br>-Weapons to solve puzzles and kill enemies<br>-Various bosses to fight<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2207940/extras/5fb023770c799f2c40b8a29deff89029.poster.avif?t=1667592454\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2207940/extras/5fb023770c799f2c40b8a29deff89029.webm?t=1667592454\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2207940/extras/5fb023770c799f2c40b8a29deff89029.mp4?t=1667592454\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2207940/extras/561e86178e2cd8d44769e4d4d674d6b8.poster.avif?t=1667592454\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2207940/extras/561e86178e2cd8d44769e4d4d674d6b8.webm?t=1667592454\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2207940/extras/561e86178e2cd8d44769e4d4d674d6b8.mp4?t=1667592454\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
